{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u00a0<strong>Pineapple Legend</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3549820/extras/e67817414bbcde9ff58bb1688b65e14e.avif?t=1771018599\" width=320 height=320 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u00a0Visual Novel</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3549820/extras/794bd39775ac1c4cd19af066d1f2f14a.poster.avif?t=1771018599\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3549820/extras/794bd39775ac1c4cd19af066d1f2f14a.webm?t=1771018599\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3549820/extras/794bd39775ac1c4cd19af066d1f2f14a.mp4?t=1771018599\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Find the Golden Pineapple in 6 surprising chapters and one Prologue</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Investigate among <strong>20 different cases</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve <strong>a dozen puzzles</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect <strong>over 200 cards</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore <strong>the city of Takitani</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Catch <strong>around sixty fish</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Garden <strong>in your own backyard</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Equip <strong>a variety of accessories and gear</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Eat <strong>food (sometimes weird...)</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Increase your affinity with other characters <strong>through dialogue, gifts, and quests</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Level up <strong>to progress in your adventures</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face <strong>enemies in the Colosseum</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Customize your own character</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take part in <strong>various mini-games</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock <strong>over 100 achievements</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >----</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>An Incredible Story:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3549820/extras/03e0e95b6496988c01a28ea6efc63389.poster.avif?t=1771018599\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3549820/extras/03e0e95b6496988c01a28ea6efc63389.webm?t=1771018599\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3549820/extras/03e0e95b6496988c01a28ea6efc63389.mp4?t=1771018599\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Story:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >During the <strong>500th anniversary of the Golden Pineapple</strong>, a grand ceremony was held to celebrate the event. However, amidst the festivities, a <strong>power outage</strong> suddenly plunged the venue into darkness. When the lights returned, the pineapple had <strong>vanished from its pedestal</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dark clouds began to gather over the city, the rain poured down in a torrential downpour, and violent gusts of wind howled through the streets. Thunder rumbled, illuminating the sky with blinding flashes, each accompanied by an <strong>eerie, deafening roar</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After several long hours, the storm finally subsided. But as the frightened citizens stepped out into the drenched streets, their fear only grew\u2014<strong>a Mayan corpse lay juxtaposed at the center of the town hall</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The police quickly assembled, joined by the <strong>BAD</strong> (Bureau of Advanced Detection). <strong>Oph\u00e9lie and Sacha</strong> began their search for a skilled investigator to uncover the truth behind this bizarre event.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And now, the fate of this mystery <strong>rests in your hands!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So, will you be able to\u2026</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Find the Golden Pineapple?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >---</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Surprisingly Hilarious Investigations:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3549820/extras/3b636186a29db0c4a23a603f32b36653.avif?t=1771018599\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take part in <strong>bizarre and twisted cases</strong> (<i>Yogurt Poisoning, The Spoon Murderer, The French Fry Gun, or The Resurrection of the Toilet Paper Mummy\u2026</i>)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the <strong>four branching paths</strong> of each investigation, where <strong>choices will alter both the case and its culprit</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gather clues in your investigation journal, analyze evidence, examine alibis, and interrogate characters!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Around twenty thrilling cases to solve!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Each side case is unique and brings its own set of surprises to keep the investigations fresh and exciting.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3549820/extras/8b04060d5e14a4b9ff9ce4f5c490b463.poster.avif?t=1771018599\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3549820/extras/8b04060d5e14a4b9ff9ce4f5c490b463.webm?t=1771018599\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3549820/extras/8b04060d5e14a4b9ff9ce4f5c490b463.mp4?t=1771018599\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Customize Your Character and Make Them UNIQUE!</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Choose your identity.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Change your character\u2019s skin color.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pick your hair color.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Modify outfits or their colors.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Equip accessories like police badges.</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your character will look just how you want, but <strong>their posture and hairstyles will remain the same throughout the game.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >---</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Solve Mysterious Puzzles!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3549820/extras/3638ed2e0d39d3e19ca212aff4b0fd8a.poster.avif?t=1771018599\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3549820/extras/3638ed2e0d39d3e19ca212aff4b0fd8a.webm?t=1771018599\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3549820/extras/3638ed2e0d39d3e19ca212aff4b0fd8a.mp4?t=1771018599\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >---</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Catch a Multitude of Fish!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3549820/extras/6e8bc88c64e2427e22f87fb8b2eb674b.poster.avif?t=1771018599\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3549820/extras/6e8bc88c64e2427e22f87fb8b2eb674b.webm?t=1771018599\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3549820/extras/6e8bc88c64e2427e22f87fb8b2eb674b.mp4?t=1771018599\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >----</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Explore the city!</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3549820/extras/5e994a01339a11245ba8711a525fcedd.poster.avif?t=1771018599\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3549820/extras/5e994a01339a11245ba8711a525fcedd.webm?t=1771018599\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3549820/extras/5e994a01339a11245ba8711a525fcedd.mp4?t=1771018599\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Conclusion:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pineapple Legend</strong> is primarily a detective game, designed to be accessible to all players\u2014even those who don\u2019t necessarily enjoy visual novels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The freedom offered by <strong>Pineapple Legend</strong> allows players to enjoy <strong>various different experiences</strong>, all while preserving the core <strong>visual novel</strong> essence!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game features <strong>rich and humorous gameplay</strong>, and as Oph\u00e9lie would say:<br><i>&quot;Ze crois que on va z'amuzer!&quot;</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meanwhile, Sacha is far too busy tending to his <strong>glorious hair</strong>\u2026 Unbelievable, these two goofballs\u2026 Thankfully, <strong>your character is here to make up for their shortcomings!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Even though, perhaps, it\u2019s finally time to\u2026 <strong>recover the Golden Pineapple\u2026</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So, what are you waiting for, <strong>detective?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3549820/extras/e67817414bbcde9ff58bb1688b65e14e.avif?t=1771018599\" width=320 height=320 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>We wish you a fantastic adventure.</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>May the stars align in your favor!</strong> \u2728</h2>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3549820?t=1771018599","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3549820?t=1771018599","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3549820/87710ec1894a867933bb1bf9c6df7d5f4c59f3c1/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1771018599","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3549820/87710ec1894a867933bb1bf9c6df7d5f4c59f3c1/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1771018599","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"The game does not contain any NSFW images; however, some dialogues may include more or less subtle allusions."},"demos":[{"appid":4120840,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u00a0<strong>Pineapple Legend</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3549820/extras/e67817414bbcde9ff58bb1688b65e14e.avif?t=1771018599\" width=320 height=320 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u00a0Visual Novel</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3549820/extras/794bd39775ac1c4cd19af066d1f2f14a.poster.avif?t=1771018599\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3549820/extras/794bd39775ac1c4cd19af066d1f2f14a.webm?t=1771018599\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3549820/extras/794bd39775ac1c4cd19af066d1f2f14a.mp4?t=1771018599\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Find the Golden Pineapple in 6 surprising chapters and one Prologue</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Investigate among <strong>20 different cases</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solve <strong>a dozen puzzles</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Colle