 branching paths</strong> of each investigation, where <strong>choices will alter both the case and its culprit</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gather clues in your investigation journal, analyze evidence, examine alibis, and interrogate characters!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Around twenty thrilling cases to solve!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Each side case is unique and brings its own set of surprises to keep the investigations fresh and exciting.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3549820/extras/8b04060d5e14a4b9ff9ce4f5c490b463.poster.avif?t=1771018599\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3549820/extras/8b04060d5e14a4b9ff9ce4f5c490b463.webm?t=1771018599\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3549820/extras/8b04060d5e14a4b9ff9ce4f5c490b463.mp4?t=1771018599\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Customize Your Character and Make Them UNIQUE!</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Choose your identity.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Change your character\u2019s skin color.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pick your hair color.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Modify outfits or their colors.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Equip accessories like police badges.</strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your character will look just how you want, but <strong>their posture and hairstyles will remain the same throughout the game.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >---</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Solve Mysterious Puzzles!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3549820/extras/3638ed2e0d39d3e19ca212aff4b0fd8a.poster.avif?t=1771018599\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3549820/extras/3638ed2e0d39d3e19ca212aff4b0fd8a.webm?t=1771018599\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3549820/extras/3638ed2e0d39d3e19ca212aff4b0fd8a.mp4?t=1771018599\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >---</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Catch a Multitude of Fish!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3549820/extras/6e8bc88c64e2427e22f87fb8b2eb674b.poster.avif?t=1771018599\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3549820/extras/6e8bc88c64e2427e22f87fb8b2eb674b.webm?t=1771018599\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3549820/extras/6e8bc88c64e2427e22f87fb8b2eb674b.mp4?t=1771018599\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >----</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Explore the city!</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3549820/extras/5e994a01339a11245ba8711a525fcedd.poster.avif?t=1771018599\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3549820/extras/5e994a01339a11245ba8711a525fcedd.webm?t=1771018599\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3549820/extras/5e994a01339a11245ba8711a525fcedd.mp4?t=1771018599\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Conclusion:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pineapple Legend</strong> is primarily a detective game, designed to be accessible to all players\u2014even those who don\u2019t necessarily enjoy visual novels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The freedom offered by <strong>Pineapple Legend</strong> allows players to enjoy <strong>various different experiences</strong>, all while preserving the core <strong>visual novel</strong> essence!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game features <strong>rich and humorous gameplay</strong>, and as Oph\u00e9lie would say:<br><i>&quot;Ze crois que on va z'amuzer!&quot;</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Meanwhile, Sacha is far too busy tending to his <strong>glorious hair</strong>\u2026 Unbelievable, these two goofballs\u2026 Thankfully, <strong>your character is here to make up for their shortcomings!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Even though, perhaps, it\u2019s finally time to\u2026 <strong>recover the Golden Pineapple\u2026</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So, what are you waiting for, <strong>detective?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3549820/extras/e67817414bbcde9ff58bb1688b65e14e.avif?t=1771018599\" width=320 height=320 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>We wish you a fantastic adventure.</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_ta